<title>USA: CCC buys 2,000 tonnes US sunflower oil for Bosnia.</title>
<headline>CCC buys 2,000 tonnes US sunflower oil for Bosnia.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-05-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Commodity Credit Corp of the U.S. Agriculture Department bought 2,000 tonnes of U.S. sunflower seed oil for $933.65 per tonne for donation to Bosnia.</p>
<p>The soyoil was purchased from Cal Western Packaging Corp of Memphis. Shipment was slated for June 21-July 5 and July 21-August 5, CCC said.</p>
<p>((Chicago Newsdesk 312-408-8720))</p>
